It would be helpful to have this message, but it would be better to allow users to change it at will. So, we can remove it. Maybe the user should just specify the message based on the result:

```ts
const result = await toSSG(app, fs)
if (result.success) {
  console.log('Static site generation completed!')
} else {
  console.log('Failed!', result.error.message())
}
```

